.878ex\" height=\"2.507ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1086 4366 1108\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(7.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(51,32)\"><use data-c=\"20D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-20D7\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(773.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1773.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(170.5,272)\"><use data-c=\"20D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-20D7\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2810.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(3866,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Therefore, the magnetic force experienced by the electron is also zero:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.05ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"5.843ex\" height=\"2.5ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1083 2582.6 1105\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D439\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D439\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(225,269)\"><use data-c=\"20D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-20D7\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1026.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2082.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>As a result, the electron will not experience any magnetic force (Option B) and will continue to move along the axis of the solenoid with constant velocity (Option C).</p>\n<p>Thus, the correct answer is:</p>\n<p>B and C only</p>\n","qKey":"1lgswj9wf","paperKey":"jee-main-2023-online-11th-april-evening-shift","exam":"jee-main"}]}